# Agent guardrails

These limits apply to every task in this repository.

- Do not use Desktop Commander or other machine connectors. That includes the `desktop-commander` and `Dc-xai` MCP namespaces, their CLIs, and any device bridge they open.
- Do not read, write, copy, or print credential files, `.env*` files, `*device.json` files, or token stores. The blocked locations include `.desktop-commander-device/`, `.claude-server-commander/`, `.hscli`, and `.witnessops-token-store/`.
- Do not merge, deploy, force-push, or write to `main`. Commit and push only on the task branch.
- Open draft PRs only. Start each task from a new branch off `main`. One PR per task.
- Do not weaken tests, CI gates, or hook denials to make a check pass.

End every task with a readback:

- branch name
- head SHA
- files changed
- commands run, each with pass and fail counts
- unknowns
